{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04725","headline":"扈从温泉宫献诗 · 张说","name":"扈从温泉宫献诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"温泉啓蛰气氛氲，渭浦归鸿日数羣。\n骑仗联联环北极，鸣笳步步引南熏。\n松间彩殿笼佳气，山上朱旗绕瑞云。\n不知远梦华胥国，何如亲奉帝尧君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04725.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04725","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}